id: pm-review-d4u9
title: "Align the tracker identity test with the reference-tag rule: a gh: tag is not an importer identity"
description: "At main commit 379abdd, test/tracker-identity.test.ts failed with 'Duplicate importer identity unbraind/pm-review#57: pm-review-sync-identity and pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-57'. Verification showed that only pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-57 claims the importer identity: it carries github_number 57 and github_url. The curated pm-review-sync-identity carries only the gh:unbraind/pm-review#57 reference tag, which under the unbraind/pm-github#230 rule is a reference, not an identity. The defect was in the test, which counted reference tags as ownership, not in the tracker data."
type: Issue
status: closed
