  "2026-11-28T07:20:15.692Z","harness:claude-code","Corrected the description (CodeRabbit on PR 115): there is exactly one importer-identity claimant for issue 57, pm-review-github-d686d81c4a08-57. pm-review-sync-identity only cites the issue by reference tag. The fix landed in PR 116 (merge b08af7f), which aligned test/tracker-identity.test.ts with the rule, added a true-duplicate case that still fails, and linked the two items with a related dependency."
